Data reaches the companion by three roads: a system's own interface, a file you export, or the app exporting a report for you. The app tries the safest road first. Whatever the road, the data arrives with the same label: which system, which company, which period, when it was fetched, and how complete it is.

Source locator: DAYS[3].blocks[0]
{
  "what": "Data reaches the companion by three roads: a system's own interface, a file you export, or the app exporting a report for you. The app tries the safest road first. Whatever the road, the data arrives with the same label: which system, which company, which period, when it was fetched, and how complete it is.",
