  "architectureNodes": "own=1. The system's own interface|file=2. A file you export|comp=3. The app exports it for you|feed=Later: a live bank feed through a partner;env=One envelope: which system, company, period, when fetched, how complete;chk=Is it complete, and for the right company;rec=Yes: on to the recipe|no=No: refused, with the reason",
