    },
    {
      "w": "fleet",
      "do": "Pipeline posts the envelope fields. Open the diagram and trace the three roads into the one envelope. Point at the dashed box: a live bank feed is not part of these ten days, because only a regulated company is allowed to pull it. Say that plainly."
