      "w": "check",
      "do": "When Pipeline reports, paste:",
      "prompt": "Pipeline, show two envelopes side by side on screen: the Tally sales register fetched through the XML interface, and the same report read from an exported file. Then open one receipt and point at the line that says which road was used and how old the data is.",
      "say": "Same report, two roads, one envelope. The receipt tells you which road was used and how fresh the data is."
    }
  ],
