When the companion cannot tell what a field means, it stops, gives one of five written reasons, and asks you one question. The question and your answer are saved, so the next business with the same set-up may not need to be asked. Fields that no recipe covers go on a list you can see.

Source locator: DAYS[3].blocks[6]
{
  "what": "When the companion cannot tell what a field means, it stops, gives one of five written reasons, and asks you one question. The question and your answer are saved, so the next business with the same set-up may not need to be asked. Fields that no recipe covers go on a list you can see.",
  "piece": "mapping",
