The Monday brief can reach you by mail and by WhatsApp. The message holds a headline and a link. It holds no figures, no names and no amounts. It is read-only: you cannot ask it a question or approve anything from it. WhatsApp needs Meta to verify the business and approve the message templates, which you applied for on day 1. If the approval has not arrived, mail is shown and WhatsApp is marked partial.

