A workspace for one person becomes a workspace for two. Each person gets a seat: a named place in the workspace with a role. Each machine gets its own key. The second founder on camera is a made-up account on a second machine you can see. Moheek tests the same build off camera.

Source locator: DAYS[5].blocks[0]
{
  "what": "A workspace for one person becomes a workspace for two. Each person gets a seat: a named place in the workspace with a role. Each machine gets its own key. The second founder on camera is a made-up account on a second machine you can see. Moheek tests the same build off camera.",
