  "instructions": [
    {
      "w": "say",
      "say": "Until today this workspace had one person in it: me. Today it gets a second person and a second machine. Each person gets a seat. A seat is a named place in the workspace, with a role. Each machine gets its own key. You will see a second laptop on screen all day. The person on it is a made-up cofounder called Meera. My real cofounder Moheek is testing the same build off camera, on his own machine."
    },
