      "w": "check",
      "do": "After the break, on machine one, open the trust panel and show the seats list and the machines list. Then paste:",
      "prompt": "Ledger, post the record lines for today's invites on the demo workspace: who invited, which seat, which machine, when. Then show that an agent started by Meera Demo cannot read a report that Meera Demo cannot read. No codes and no email addresses in your answer.",
      "say": "Two people, two machines, one workspace. And a helper agent never gets more power than the person who asked."
    }
  ],
