      "w": "do",
      "do": "Open the Build room. Paste:",
      "prompt": "Ledger, start block 2 with Brain and Warden: one policy decision function inside the engine process, called for every read, every model send and every effect. Fixed evaluation order: (1) hard deny, (2) effect-class hold (money, messages to outsiders, deleting, anything that cannot be undone), (3) per-operation rule, (4) standing policy, (5) ask the person. Deny always wins. When nothing matches, send and do are refused and read asks. The decision (rule id, step number, principal, device, time) is attached to every receipt and written to the record. The screen and every local interface call the same function: there is no second path. Write docs/policy.md with the rule grammar: subject (seat or agent), verb (see, send, keep, do), object (source, definition, marking, action), condition (period, amount limit, end date). Add a table-driven test suite of at least 40 cases, including rules that conflict. Post the rule order and the test count. Report as Changed / Verified / Partial / Needs."
    },
