requirements.requirement:
Every way of reaching an AI model takes the same tests today, five times each. The pass bars are said out loud before the run starts. The table shows, for each route: right, wrong, refused, how often a person had to step in, and the cost in rupees per job. The engines that the fleet itself runs on are factory tools and are not in the table.

