When a new system is connected, the companion first looks up the most similar setups in the recipe library and puts the recipes that passed their tests beside the AI as examples. Rules then remove anything that cannot be true, such as a field name that does not exist. These are the first two rungs of the training ladder. No model is trained in these ten days.

