  ]
}

A new install asks before every action. You switch on 'run on its own' for one kind of action at a time. Only actions that can be undone and that stay inside your own systems have a switch, and they run within daily caps. Money, messages to outsiders, deleting, and anything that cannot be undone (prices, stock, listings, sharing, tax filings) have no switch: they always wait for you.

