  "id": "main",
  "title": "The order for Chief",
  "room": "Build room",
  "goal": "Ship the release and prepare everything that goes public with it. Nothing new is built today: the build is frozen at the day-9 tag, plus fixes and the small release tools. Start from your morning report: every partial item from days 1 to 9 comes first. You prepare. I publish.",
  "first": "Cut the release candidate from the day-9 tag plus fixes. Post its version number and its checksum. Every test today names this exact build.",
